                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-3">Reverse-Engineering Global Ticketing APIs</h2>

                <p class="text-brand-muted mb-6 leading-relaxed flex-grow">
                    <strong>The Challenge:</strong> A global ticketing platform needed its legacy, multi-layered event data
                    integrated into our CDP. Documentation was fragmented, and venues and events were related in ways the structure did not make obvious.
                    <br><br>
                    <strong>My Solution:</strong> I manually mapped the API logic, reverse-engineering the data
                    relationships. I designed the JSON transformation schema and guided Engineering on the exact
                    implementation path, so their whole event catalogue could be standardised at once.
                    <br><br>
                    <strong>The Outcome:</strong> Real-time segmentation across their full event history, with the
                    legacy dependency still intact.
                </p>

