                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-3">Segmentation Engine Migration</h2>

                <p class="text-brand-muted mb-6 leading-relaxed flex-grow">
                    <strong>The Challenge:</strong> Every customer account had to move from an old segmentation
                    engine to a new one, with every segment rebuilt rule by rule. Done by hand it was slow, repetitive
                    work, and the larger the account the worse it got.
                    <br><br>
                    <strong>My Solution:</strong> I built an AI toolkit backed by a knowledge library of how the
                    platform is configured. It reads the SQL behind the existing segments, triages what needs
                    recreating, bootstraps the new engine and rebuilds the rules and segments through the portal's
                    API.
                    <br><br>
                    <strong>The Outcome:</strong> A migration became a single planning phase. The same toolkit now
                    builds dashboards and analytics tables from a customer's raw data sources.
                </p>

